{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf Brisca Like Never Before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate the <strong>10th anniversary</strong> of the most popular <strong>card game by Quarzo Apps</strong> with this fully revamped version of <strong>Brisca</strong>. Enjoy fast-paced, strategic matches in <strong>online multiplayer</strong>, <strong>offline vs AI</strong>, or <strong>practice mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete and customizable experience faithful to the traditional <strong>Spanish card game</strong>, now with improved graphics, powerful new features, and smooth gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf High-definition cards, customizable backs, and smooth animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 Play in <strong>portrait or landscape mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 Use the <strong>Spanish, French, or Italian (Napoletane) deck</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Smart AI with 4 difficulty levels and configurable rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Online multiplayer with friends</strong> or single-player games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd08 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 Full tutorial and in-game help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Advanced settings: card size, rules, effects, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b Graphics optimized for low battery consumption.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode (with undo option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brisca</strong> (also known as <strong>Briscola</strong> or <strong>Briscas</strong>) is a traditional card game played in <strong>Spain</strong>, <strong>Italy</strong>, <strong>Puerto Rico</strong>, <strong>Cuba</strong>, and many other countries. The goal is to win tricks and collect the highest-scoring cards. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/f7ba5c24fcab8254c3e37365583c1e5762218fb7.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/9ee51e636f520408c81c3c4d54e4e0306859eb70.jpg"},{"name":"You have got it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/28916d8e4058c0f9064c5540407d6ed33b3f1b81.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 1)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/83e954564bf26bb843995c81a9e3b8d3274b14af.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 2)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/cf36d14787b3c74f6e6231e6ff40a73f057763c3.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 3)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/3edd75bf9cff93e4a71958236815c47a2cebd6c8.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 4)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/0cd807b4b738ce927ef1b065062868b93fbe29f3.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 5)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/abd01ab49566e5f015a749f3d7e5abe89c5b4eed.jpg"},{"name":"I vs 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866010/5a72a32c3c340fa7abe84be5619f8f8b7114bc8e.jpg"},{"name":"I vs 3 Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co