>Spanish, French, or Italian (Napoletane) deck</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Smart AI with 4 difficulty levels and configurable rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Online multiplayer with friends</strong> or single-player games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd08 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 Full tutorial and in-game help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Advanced settings: card size, rules, effects, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b Graphics optimized for low battery consumption.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode (with undo option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer (coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brisca</strong> (also known as <strong>Briscola</strong> or <strong>Briscas</strong>) is a traditional card game played in <strong>Spain</strong>, <strong>Italy</strong>, <strong>Puerto Rico</strong>, <strong>Cuba</strong>, and many other countries. The goal is to win tricks and collect the highest-scoring cards. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p>","developers":["Quarzo Aplicaciones y Juegos SL"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866010/cfed5e84f7b468f2667e3dc9f00b61218020370f/header.jpg?t=1753781113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866010/1770798430/0b7100597fd3b022a5ba696f8703bc7839ade58d/1751965558/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752518439","